# Entity-Scoped Memory
created: undefined, last updated: 2026-06-06, [Read more](https://docs.mem0.ai/platform/features/entity-scoped-memory)

* **Reads** (`client.search`, `client.get_all`, exports, deletes) accept the same identifiers inside the `filters` JSON object.
...
Plan searches per entity scope or combine scopes with `OR`.
...
agent_scope = {
"AND": [
{"agent_id": "travel_planner"},
{"app_id": "concierge_portal"}
]
}
agent_results = client.search("Any dietary flags?", filters=agent_scope)
print(agent_results)
...
Writes can include multiple identifiers, but searches resolve one entity space at a time.
Query user scope *or* agent scope in a given call—combining both returns an empty list today.
...
